{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1482254-i-m-just-going-to-say-it","id":1482254,"title":"I'm just going to say it...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-05-29T08:55:59-07:00","id":1482254,"title":"I'm just going to say it...","content":"The rate of releases for this edition is a joke. In a world where the developers could put out a hundred charms a month, have them &quot;fixed&quot; in real time after playtesting from the fanbase, easily updated and re-uploaded on drivethrurpg, there is no excuse for taking nearly a decade to come out with the handful of books we have. My group errata'd the convoluted mess that is the solar charm set in little over a month and we have full time jobs and weren't getting paid to do it.<br /> <br /> Even after the departure of the original developer knuckleheads, the rate of production is ridiculous. I know everyone wants the best for this edition that is working on it but come on.<br /> <br /> Anyways, this is mostly just a bitchy rant but it's sad to see something with potential bogged down by so much procrastination. The 3rd edition has existed almost as long as the first two editions combined with about 1/20th of the releases lol. If I was getting paid to write Exalted, I'd be just dumping out information to the fanbase and letting them sort out what they wanted to use or what shouldn't exist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}